, and turn around with ample daylight so the walk stays a relaxed first-weekend outing.","short_summary":"An expansive public outdoor recreation area along the Red River.","evidence_claim":"The City of Grand Forks describes the Greenway as a 2,200-acre outdoor recreational area spanning Grand Forks and East Grand Forks.","source_url":"https://www.grandforksgov.com/government/city-departments/public-works/public-works-stormwater/greenway","source_title":"Greenway | City of Grand Forks, ND","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Use the City’s Greenway maps and activity information to select an appropriate route and conditions.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"und-university-park","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"University Park","title":"Pause at University Park","subtitle":"Saturday late afternoon · 320 N 25th Street","notes":"Use the park as a calm reset between campus plans; in winter, check whether an outdoor-rink activity is scheduled before making it your destination.","short_summary":"A nearby named park that also hosts outdoor-rink programming.","evidence_claim":"UND’s calendar lists University Park at 320 N 25th Street and identifies its Outdoor Rink as the location for rink scrimmages.","source_url":"https://calendar.und.edu/university-park","source_title":"University Park | University of North Dakota","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Outdoor-rink activities are seasonal; check the calendar and weather before traveling there.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"und-chester-fritz-performing-arts-center","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Chester Fritz Performing Arts Center","title":"Choose an evening at the Chester Fritz","subtitle":"Saturday ev